{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>אשרי, לשקוד על דלתותי</b> — the meaning is upon habit and fixed residence in houses of wisdom. And since he said 'דלתותי,' he said 'מזוזת פתחי' — a doubling of meaning. And it is possible to interpret: פתחי — the beginnings of wisdom, and its doors and its doorposts are the devices in every wisdom, and they are the first intelligibles, and from them the inquiries are assembled, and to them the correct conclusions return. And this is the meaning of 'לשמר.'"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:36.147850156Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}